{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:56:32+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T16:56:32+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Pharmanutra S.p.A.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic","country":"Italy","city":"Pisa","website":"https://www.pharmanutra.it","employees":144,"summary":"Pharmanutra S.p.A., a nutraceutical company, engages in the research and development and marketing of food supplements and medical devices in Europe, the Middle East, Far East, North America, South America, and internationally. The company produces and distributes raw materials and active ingredients for the food, pharmaceutical, and dietary supplement industries. It offers Sucrosomial, a delivery system that optimises nutrient transport and absorption for minimising gastrointestinal side effects; and Cetylated Fatty Acids, a formulation for muscle and joint recovery in physiotherapy and sports. The company also sells instrumentation and software for body bioimpedance analysis through agents, distributors, and online sales. Pharmanutra S.p.A. was founded in 2000 and is headquartered in Pisa, Italy.","exchange":"Milan","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Pharmanutra S.p.A., une société nutraceutique, se consacre à la recherche et au développement et à la commercialisation de compléments alimentaires et de dispositifs médicaux en Europe, au Moyen-Orient, en Extrême-Orient, en Amérique du Nord, en Amérique du Sud et à l’international. La société produit et distribue des matières premières et des ingrédients actifs pour les industries alimentaire, pharmaceutique et des compléments alimentaires. Il offre Sucrosomial, un système d'administration qui optimise le transport et l'absorption des nutriments pour minimiser les effets secondaires gastro-intestinaux; et Acides Gras Cétylés, une formulation pour la récupération musculaire et arti